      ":question/id": "ca2ffe20-8a8b-51fe-9a95-fa49f505481c",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 6 & 40\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce $M$ to row echelon form.",
